<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:16.960" end="00:00:20.320" style="s2">Is Mumbo,</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.560" end="00:00:23.600" style="s2">Golug,</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.320" end="00:00:26.280" style="s2">Cruse, Agnas Guar.</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.600" end="00:00:26.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Orcs.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.840" end="00:00:40.640" style="s2">Shadow.</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.600" end="00:01:06.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GRAC, ELGA, DRAKON, GORASH.</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.390" end="00:01:32.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.076" end="00:01:50.096" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.311" end="00:02:15.641" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.621" end="00:02:15.641" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.991" end="00:02:51.011" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.120" end="00:02:53.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GOOD JOB, SHADOW.</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.921" end="00:02:55.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.280" end="00:02:58.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WE&#39;RE SAFE NOW, but we need to hurry and</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.400" end="00:02:58.760" style="s2">warn the others. Hurry up.</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.502" end="00:03:18.522" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.200" end="00:03:38.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re almost there.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.680" end="00:03:48.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is my daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.640" end="00:03:50.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is in the forest with Shadow, my</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.280" end="00:03:50.760" style="s2">king.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.280" end="00:04:01.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For the horde!</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.840" end="00:04:10.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The orcs are coming.</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.200" end="00:04:12.240" style="s2">The orcs are coming!</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.560" end="00:04:15.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The orcs are coming! The orcs are</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.240" end="00:04:15.840" style="s2">coming! Prepare for battle!</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.000" end="00:04:26.720" style="s2">Your majesty, the orcs are coming.</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.280" end="00:04:26.720" style="s2">They&#39;re very close to the castle.</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.243" end="00:04:29.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.040" end="00:04:35.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to speak with my father.</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.280" end="00:04:39.400" style="s2">Where is he?</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.720" end="00:04:39.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He is in the palace, my princess.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.720" end="00:05:01.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alora!</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.993" end="00:05:01.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.040" end="00:05:04.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m scared.</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.919" end="00:05:05.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be. I&#39;ll protect you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.320" end="00:05:06.040" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to worry.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.160" end="00:05:07.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are there many of them?</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.040" end="00:05:07.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only a few.</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.200" end="00:05:09.440" style="s2">Don&#39;t be afraid.</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.960" end="00:05:13.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wish our elves were strong.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.440" end="00:05:13.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s no elf stronger than you, Red.</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.080" end="00:05:27.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RAJ, FRAG MO, CASH TO RACK.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.120" end="00:05:41.680" style="s2">VARK AL gur harmuk, nugataga.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.600" end="00:05:42.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grumvar, vark al gur tum nak, gromvar</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.680" end="00:05:47.640" style="s2">zarkum.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.520" end="00:05:47.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Razdur, grag mor. Vark harmuk.</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.720" end="00:06:00.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My princess.</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.360" end="00:06:07.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Orcs, thousands of them.</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.800" end="00:06:09.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much time do we have?</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.760" end="00:06:10.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If they decide to attack now, 2 hours at</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.960" end="00:06:12.320" style="s2">most.</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.600" end="00:06:12.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, they&#39;ll wait.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.320" end="00:06:13.920" style="s2">Nightfall.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.800" end="00:06:14.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father, we should leave the city while</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.920" end="00:06:15.040" style="s2">we still can.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.400" end="00:06:16.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We will not abandon it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.040" end="00:06:18.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There may be no home left to defend.</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.760" end="00:06:18.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; child, every elder man to the mountains.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.280" end="00:06:19.800" style="s2">I&#39;ll stay. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.840" end="00:06:22.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then so WILL I.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.800" end="00:06:26.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NAKHDUR ELGORMOK!</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.960" end="00:06:31.200" style="s2">NAKHDUR ELCRAKVONDRAKHNOR!</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.960" end="00:06:32.760" style="s2">GORAK! NAKHDUR THRAKHAR! VAR KARMOK!</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.200" end="00:06:34.800" style="s2">ELGORDOOM!</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.760" end="00:06:36.400" style="s2">CRASH!</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.800" end="00:06:37.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We should strike first.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.400" end="00:06:39.240" style="s2">Let them know we&#39;re not afraid.</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.600" end="00:06:40.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s madness. Whoever you send out</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.240" end="00:06:42.720" style="s2">there isn&#39;t coming back.</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.680" end="00:06:43.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My daughter, sometimes we must sacrifice</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.720" end="00:06:45.560" style="s2">a few of our own.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.520" end="00:06:48.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you send even one elf out there, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.560" end="00:06:48.440" style="s2">going with them.</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.960" end="00:06:54.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go to the war room. I have a plan.</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.960" end="00:06:54.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my king.</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.760" end="00:06:57.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The orcs will attack tonight. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.960" end="00:06:58.840" style="s2">certain of it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.600" end="00:07:00.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Princess Alana is right about their</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.840" end="00:07:01.960" style="s2">numbers, we don&#39;t stand a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.120" end="00:07:04.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perhaps not, but we will not surrender.</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.960" end="00:07:06.080" style="s2">We fight to the last. Let them see we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.280" end="00:07:07.240" style="s2">ready for war if war is what they want.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.080" end="00:07:09.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my king. I&#39;ll gather our warriors</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.240" end="00:07:10.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; General, do not let my daughter go with</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.360" end="00:07:12.160" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.520" end="00:07:14.880" style="s2">Under any circumstances. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.160" end="00:07:14.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my king.</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.040" end="00:07:27.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Assemble 200 of our best soldiers. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.040" end="00:07:27.720" style="s2">going to war. We strike the orcs before</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.000" end="00:07:29.200" style="s2">they can strike us.</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.720" end="00:07:32.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, General. I&#39;ll see to it once.</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.200" end="00:07:32.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go! Quickly!</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.920" end="00:07:59.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re sending all these elves, our own</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.880" end="00:08:01.560" style="s2">people, to their deaths.</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.600" end="00:08:02.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, Princess.</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.560" end="00:08:04.160" style="s2">Those are your father&#39;s orders.</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.760" end="00:08:05.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;m coming with you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.160" end="00:08:07.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The king expressly forbade me from</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.560" end="00:08:08.320" style="s2">taking you with us. Please, Princess.</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.120" end="00:08:10.600" style="s2">Don&#39;t make this harder than it already</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.320" end="00:08:10.600" style="s2">is.</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.010" end="00:08:27.030" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.039" end="00:08:39.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This plan won&#39;t work. I told you before,</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.919" end="00:08:40.080" style="s2">if you send our elves to attack the</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.120" end="00:08:41.800" style="s2">orcs, I&#39;m going with them.</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.080" end="00:08:42.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. You&#39;re not going anywhere. You will</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.800" end="00:08:44.320" style="s2">stay here at the castle.</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.840" end="00:08:45.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The elves you send don&#39;t stand a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.320" end="00:08:47.520" style="s2">They won&#39;t come back, FATHER.</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.320" end="00:08:51.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALORA, STOP. I SPEAK TO YOU AS your king</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.520" end="00:08:51.080" style="s2">now, not your father.</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.486" end="00:08:56.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.600" end="00:09:18.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alora,</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.720" end="00:09:18.320" style="s2">are you okay? You look angry.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.400" end="00:09:23.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red, [music] I need you. Come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.920" end="00:09:23.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are we going?</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.280" end="00:09:40.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have to leave, but the king won&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.120" end="00:09:41.520" style="s2">me. So, I&#39;m going to need your help.</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.280" end="00:09:44.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can I help you?</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.520" end="00:09:46.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red, you&#39;re half elf, half human. And</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.040" end="00:09:47.520" style="s2">besides that, you have superpowers.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.160" end="00:09:49.000" style="s2">Last year, do you remember when you</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.520" end="00:09:51.840" style="s2">teleported me?</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.000" end="00:09:54.160" style="s2">Red, put your elf ears back on. Take my</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.840" end="00:09:55.880" style="s2">hand and let&#39;s teleport right here next</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.160" end="00:09:57.160" style="s2">to the forest.</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.880" end="00:09:59.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But there are orcs there.</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.160" end="00:10:03.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. As soon as we teleport there, you</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.680" end="00:10:03.360" style="s2">teleport straight back here, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.640" end="00:10:18.560" style="s2">Red, teleport back. Now. Go, I&#39;ll hold</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.120" end="00:10:18.560" style="s2">them back.</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.600" end="00:10:40.440" style="s2">You need to teleport back to the castle.</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.480" end="00:10:42.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.440" end="00:10:43.320" style="s2">I want to stay with you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.080" end="00:10:45.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red,</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.320" end="00:10:46.560" style="s2">please. I need you to be safe. There are</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.400" end="00:10:48.360" style="s2">too many orcs here.</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.560" end="00:10:49.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I have powers. I can help you defeat</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.360" end="00:10:51.960" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.240" end="00:10:55.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you&#39;re very powerful,</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.960" end="00:10:55.680" style="s2">but I&#39;m not willing to take that risk.</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.720" end="00:11:00.720" style="s2">Please, Red.</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.440" end="00:11:00.720" style="s2">Teleport back to the castle.</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.240" end="00:11:09.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love you. Please [music] be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.520" end="00:11:16.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. We&#39;ll see each other soon.</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.200" end="00:11:18.440" style="s2">Now, come on. Go.</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.080" end="00:11:18.440" style="s2">Go.</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.120" end="00:11:30.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE ELF!</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.200" end="00:11:30.680" style="s2">GET HER!</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.927" end="00:11:38.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.883" end="00:12:18.903" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.200" end="00:12:41.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; COME ON, LADS.</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.560" end="00:12:49.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO.</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.598" end="00:12:55.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.720" end="00:13:00.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Such a small army.</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.680" end="00:13:03.440" style="s2">You came here to die.</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.120" end="00:13:03.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That remains to be seen.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.480" end="00:13:10.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m in a generous mood today.</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.640" end="00:13:10.200" style="s2">So, I&#39;ll make you an offer.</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.760" end="00:13:15.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m listening.</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.240" end="00:13:17.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your best warrior against mine.</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.920" end="00:13:19.160" style="s2">One against one.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.960" end="00:13:20.320" style="s2">The winner</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.160" end="00:13:23.000" style="s2">wins the battle.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.320" end="00:13:25.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll fight.</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.000" end="00:13:26.880" style="s2">And if I win,</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.200" end="00:13:29.800" style="s2">you will withdraw your army from</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.880" end="00:13:29.800" style="s2">Elvenland.</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.440" end="00:13:34.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So [snorts] be it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.139" end="00:13:38.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.520" end="00:13:52.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good luck.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.549" end="00:13:56.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.440" end="00:13:56.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re close. I need to hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.720" end="00:14:01.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is Elara?</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.680" end="00:14:02.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; found her, your majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.520" end="00:14:03.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep looking.</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.520" end="00:14:03.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.120" end="00:14:05.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.440" end="00:14:05.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw Princess Elara earlier.</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.000" end="00:14:07.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where?</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.720" end="00:14:08.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In the courtyard, your majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.440" end="00:14:10.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red?</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.160" end="00:14:12.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, your majesty. They were alone.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.040" end="00:14:15.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Find Red now.</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.200" end="00:14:15.320" style="s2">I&#39;ll speak to her myself.</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.600" end="00:14:17.720" style="s2">Where is Elara?</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.480" end="00:14:18.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She She went back.</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.720" end="00:14:19.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back where?</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.320" end="00:14:20.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To the battlefield.</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.320" end="00:14:21.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.480" end="00:14:22.720" style="s2">How did she leave the castle?</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.960" end="00:14:23.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I helped her.</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.720" end="00:14:24.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU DID WHAT?</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.560" end="00:14:26.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHE WANTED TO HELP THEM. I ONLY</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.720" end="00:14:29.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I TOLD HER TO STAY HERE, AND YOU HELPED</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.680" end="00:14:29.680" style="s2">HER DISOBEY ME?</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.440" end="00:14:36.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That troll is too big.</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.160" end="00:14:42.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.160" end="00:14:45.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll fight I&#39;ll fight him.</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.240" end="00:14:45.400" style="s2">I&#39;ll fight the troll.</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.560" end="00:14:49.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elara, what are you doing here? The king</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.120" end="00:14:52.080" style="s2">ordered you to stay at the castle.</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.600" end="00:14:53.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I came to help.</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.080" end="00:14:54.640" style="s2">Let me fight the troll.</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.040" end="00:14:56.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely not.</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.640" end="00:14:58.360" style="s2">Your father would kill me if he found</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.040" end="00:15:00.040" style="s2">out I allowed this.</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.360" end="00:15:01.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; General,</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.040" end="00:15:03.800" style="s2">I am the princess,</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.839" end="00:15:06.839" style="s2">and therefore, I am ordering you to</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.800" end="00:15:06.839" style="s2">stand aside.</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.975" end="00:15:20.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.320" end="00:15:31.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.695" end="00:15:36.715" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.621" end="00:15:59.641" style="s2">[cheering and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.516" end="00:16:06.200" style="s2">[screaming and groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.360" end="00:16:08.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ENOUGH!</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.200" end="00:16:10.240" style="s2">FORGET THE AGREEMENT.</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.560" end="00:16:13.080" style="s2">KILL THEM ALL! [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.240" end="00:16:13.080" style="s2">ATTACK!</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.200" end="00:16:20.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THEY&#39;VE BROKEN THEIR WORD.</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.920" end="00:16:20.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; PREPARE FOR BATTLE! SHIELDS!</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.360" end="00:16:37.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HOLD.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.160" end="00:16:40.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ARCHERS!</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.920" end="00:16:40.640" style="s2">READY!</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.839" end="00:16:44.181" style="s2">FIRE!</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.161" end="00:16:44.181" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.080" end="00:16:48.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ARROWS!</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.881" end="00:16:59.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.741" end="00:17:07.761" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.291" end="00:17:14.311" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.186" end="00:17:20.206" style="s2">[groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.426" end="00:17:25.446" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.287" end="00:17:33.307" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.562" end="00:17:36.582" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.182" end="00:17:39.202" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.457" end="00:17:42.477" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.007" end="00:17:49.027" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.417" end="00:18:05.402" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.382" end="00:18:05.402" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.622" end="00:18:10.642" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.680" end="00:18:19.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU SHOULD STAY BEHIND your walls.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.080" end="00:18:19.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you should never have come here.</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.547" end="00:18:33.567" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
