<p begin="00:18:40.717" end="00:18:42.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.400" end="00:18:51.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, princess.</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.520" end="00:18:57.093" style="s2">You&#39;ll die beside him.</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.127" end="00:18:59.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.093" end="00:18:59.113" style="s2">[groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.988" end="00:19:05.008" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.193" end="00:19:12.213" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.160" end="00:19:17.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s over, princess.</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.160" end="00:19:31.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What What is that?</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.720" end="00:19:33.600" style="s2">We can&#39;t hold them. Retreat! Everyone</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.160" end="00:19:34.760" style="s2">fall back!</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.600" end="00:19:38.413" style="s2">RUN!</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.760" end="00:19:38.413" style="s2">FALL BACK! RUN! [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.000" end="00:19:46.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DO YOU UNDERSTAND WHAT YOU&#39;VE DONE?</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.160" end="00:19:47.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was trying to help her.</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.160" end="00:19:49.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HELP? THERE ARE THOUSANDS [screaming] OF</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.480" end="00:19:50.840" style="s2">ORCS OUT THERE. ALORA IS MY DAUGHTER.</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.520" end="00:19:51.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHE PROMISED SHE&#39;D COME BACK. She</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.840" end="00:19:53.600" style="s2">doesn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.840" end="00:19:56.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Alora dies out there, it will be</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.600" end="00:19:58.520" style="s2">because you helped her leave.</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.200" end="00:20:01.283" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love her.</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.520" end="00:20:03.303" style="s2">I just wanted to help her.</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.283" end="00:20:03.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.280" end="00:20:09.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red,</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.760" end="00:20:09.240" style="s2">I [snorts] cannot lose my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.694" end="00:20:17.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.344" end="00:20:37.364" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.894" end="00:20:43.914" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.579" end="00:21:01.599" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.024" end="00:21:17.264" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.360" end="00:21:18.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; OPEN THE GATES! QUICKLY!</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.264" end="00:21:20.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.080" end="00:21:22.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KEEP MOVING!</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.040" end="00:21:25.480" style="s2">GO! GO!</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.280" end="00:21:25.480" style="s2">CLOSE THE GATES!</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.364" end="00:21:32.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.880" end="00:21:35.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT HAPPENED?</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.920" end="00:21:37.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THERE were too many of them. Thousands.</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.640" end="00:21:41.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long until they reach us?</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.240" end="00:21:41.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tonight. 3 hours at most.</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.499" end="00:21:43.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.000" end="00:21:50.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is my daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.080" end="00:21:53.945" style="s2">Where is Elara?</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.920" end="00:21:55.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, Your Majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.945" end="00:21:55.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.920" end="00:22:02.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not be afraid.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.600" end="00:22:05.160" style="s2">Tonight,</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.200" end="00:22:05.160" style="s2">we will win.</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.720" end="00:22:09.840" style="s2">We may have lost the battle,</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.680" end="00:22:13.040" style="s2">but we have not lost the war. We are</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.840" end="00:22:15.320" style="s2">elves. This is our home, and we will NOT</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.040" end="00:22:16.960" style="s2">LET THE ORCS TAKE IT FROM US. TONIGHT,</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.320" end="00:22:21.400" style="s2">WE STAND TOGETHER.</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.960" end="00:22:21.400" style="s2">AND TONIGHT, WE DEFEND OUR HOME!</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.385" end="00:22:27.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.040" end="00:22:31.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ELARA. [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.960" end="00:22:52.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; PATHETIC.</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.520" end="00:22:53.550" style="s2">Looks like we&#39;re eating well tonight.</p>
