<p begin="00:22:53.550" end="00:22:55.570" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.440" end="00:23:21.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GROKNOR VORA!</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.760" end="00:23:21.760" style="s2">ELGOTHRAK MORGAKRA!</p>
