<p begin="00:24:26.561" end="00:24:28.581" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.662" end="00:24:41.682" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.212" end="00:24:48.232" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.417" end="00:24:55.437" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.722" end="00:25:15.742" style="s2">[groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.480" end="00:25:29.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fall back to the citadel. Retreat. Move.</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.520" end="00:25:29.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.600" end="00:25:37.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move. Fall back. GET INSIDE.</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.957" end="00:25:39.977" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.080" end="00:25:44.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FALL BACK.</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.640" end="00:25:47.960" style="s2">TO THE CITADEL.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.360" end="00:25:47.960" style="s2">YOUR MAJESTY, NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.160" end="00:25:56.560" style="s2">CLOSE THE GATES.</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.480" end="00:25:56.560" style="s2">BAR THE GATES.</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.320" end="00:26:00.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THIS IS OUR LAST LINE OF DEFENSE.</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.720" end="00:26:06.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look around you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.800" end="00:26:08.080" style="s2">These are the last walls of our kingdom.</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.720" end="00:26:09.320" style="s2">By sunrise,</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.080" end="00:26:11.680" style="s2">perhaps none of us will still be</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.320" end="00:26:12.880" style="s2">standing.</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.680" end="00:26:14.840" style="s2">Tonight,</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.880" end="00:26:17.440" style="s2">we do not fight to survive.</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.840" end="00:26:21.080" style="s2">We fight so they will never forget</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.440" end="00:26:21.080" style="s2">what it cost to destroy us.</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.120" end="00:26:26.000" style="s2">If this is where our story ends,</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.160" end="00:26:28.640" style="s2">then let it end with swords in our</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.000" end="00:26:28.640" style="s2">hands.</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.240" end="00:26:33.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Again.</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.200" end="00:26:38.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But if they want our kingdom, they will</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.760" end="00:26:39.040" style="s2">pay for every step, every hall, EVERY</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.000" end="00:26:39.528" style="s2">STONE.</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.040" end="00:26:40.183" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NEVER.</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.528" end="00:26:42.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.183" end="00:26:42.203" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.920" end="00:26:46.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE ELVES DID NOT KNEEL.</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.760" end="00:26:48.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; UNTIL DEATH.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.840" end="00:26:49.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; UNTIL DEATH.</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.240" end="00:26:50.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; UNTIL [screaming] DEATH.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.560" end="00:26:50.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; UNTIL DEATH.</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.663" end="00:26:53.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.880" end="00:26:54.593" style="s2">&gt;&gt; UNTIL DEATH.</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.000" end="00:26:56.613" style="s2">BREAK IT DOWN!</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.593" end="00:26:56.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.080" end="00:27:13.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;M HUNGRY.</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.680" end="00:27:15.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ME, TOO.</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.640" end="00:27:17.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s stop and eat one of the</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.680" end="00:27:19.680" style="s2">elves.</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.720" end="00:27:22.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t like them raw.</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.680" end="00:27:23.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s make a fire and roast one.</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.200" end="00:27:25.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NOW YOU&#39;RE TALKING.</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.160" end="00:27:25.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STOP!</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.920" end="00:27:30.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MAKE THE FIRE.</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.840" end="00:27:40.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALORA.</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.520" end="00:27:46.880" style="s2">I HAVE to save Alora.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.280" end="00:27:53.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those elves look delicious.</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.080" end="00:27:57.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We should have been with the others</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.040" end="00:27:59.800" style="s2">attacking the Elven Citadel.</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.440" end="00:28:03.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nah, they don&#39;t need us.</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.800" end="00:28:03.520" style="s2">They&#39;ve probably taken it by now.</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.040" end="00:28:11.284" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally, no more elves in these lands.</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.264" end="00:28:11.284" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.920" end="00:28:24.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you hear that?</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.680" end="00:28:31.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t hear anything.</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.560" end="00:28:33.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fire&#39;s ready. Come on, let&#39;s roast host</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.560" end="00:28:36.960" style="s2">an elf.</p>
