<p begin="00:28:49.320" end="00:28:53.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll start [music] with the fingers.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.040" end="00:28:56.080" style="s2">Then the hand.</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.080" end="00:28:56.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
