<p begin="00:28:58.880" end="00:29:02.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.010" end="00:29:04.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.480" end="00:29:07.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well,</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.840" end="00:29:10.200" style="s2">looks like we&#39;ve got extra food.</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.840" end="00:29:12.760" style="s2">The little one looks delicious. Bring</p>
