<p begin="00:29:26.720" end="00:29:30.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; COME ON. WHAT ARE YOU DOING?</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.320" end="00:29:37.440" style="s2">WHAT THE HELL?</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.135" end="00:29:53.465" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.445" end="00:29:53.465" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.160" end="00:30:29.400" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.680" end="00:30:29.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALORA.</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.435" end="00:30:33.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.880" end="00:30:34.676" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re alive. Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.480" end="00:30:36.480" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.676" end="00:30:39.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.480" end="00:30:39.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.600" end="00:30:45.520" style="s2">Can you hear me?</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.480" end="00:30:48.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alora.</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.520" end="00:30:52.480" style="s2">Alora. Alora, I need you.</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.480" end="00:30:52.480" style="s2">Please open your eyes. Please.</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.520" end="00:30:56.520" style="s2">Please don&#39;t leave me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.876" end="00:31:02.896" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.880" end="00:31:07.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to lose you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.146" end="00:31:25.166" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.901" end="00:31:38.921" style="s2">[groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.160" end="00:31:59.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Push them back.</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.760" end="00:32:05.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; PUSH THEM BACK.</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.687" end="00:32:11.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.997" end="00:32:11.017" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.720" end="00:32:27.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send them back where they came from.</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.372" end="00:32:27.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.267" end="00:32:33.287" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.742" end="00:33:04.072" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.052" end="00:33:04.072" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.187" end="00:33:15.207" style="s2">[screaming and groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.113" end="00:33:38.133" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.400" end="00:33:42.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red, is that you?</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.663" end="00:33:47.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.920" end="00:33:47.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am so happy to see you, Red.</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.868" end="00:33:52.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.120" end="00:33:53.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened with the orcs? Did they</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.480" end="00:33:54.920" style="s2">attack the castle?</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.640" end="00:33:57.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.920" end="00:34:00.080" style="s2">The castle is under attack right now.</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.640" end="00:34:01.400" style="s2">There&#39;s so many of them. We don&#39;t stand</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.080" end="00:34:04.120" style="s2">a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.400" end="00:34:04.120" style="s2">My father.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.480" end="00:34:06.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red,</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.400" end="00:34:08.520" style="s2">we have [gasps] to teleport to the</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.640" end="00:34:12.793" style="s2">castle. We have to save him.</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.520" end="00:34:14.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, you&#39;re still weak. You need to rest.</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.793" end="00:34:14.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.068" end="00:34:18.520" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.159" end="00:34:20.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have to save my father.</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.520" end="00:34:22.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to take you to the elves who</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.040" end="00:34:25.200" style="s2">retreated into the mountains.</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.639" end="00:34:28.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to fight.</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.200" end="00:34:28.760" style="s2">I want to defend the castle.</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.639" end="00:34:33.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take my hand.</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.989" end="00:35:00.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.194" end="00:35:07.214" style="s2">[groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.734" end="00:35:51.754" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.895" end="00:36:38.915" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.760" end="00:37:12.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The king?</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.600" end="00:37:14.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE KING HAS FALLEN. [screaming] RUN FOR</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.600" end="00:37:18.040" style="s2">YOUR LIVES. RUN!</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.840" end="00:37:18.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FALL BACK. FALL BACK.</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.760" end="00:37:23.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT ARE WE GOING TO DO?</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.800" end="00:37:28.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re doomed.</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.501" end="00:37:38.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.960" end="00:37:45.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The castle is as good as lost.</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.680" end="00:37:50.560" style="s2">I&#39;ve never seen so many orcs [music] in</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.920" end="00:37:50.560" style="s2">my life.</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.360" end="00:38:01.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.920" end="00:38:08.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We lost our home.</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.400" end="00:38:12.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are we going to do now?</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.320" end="00:38:20.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Princess Allura.</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.720" end="00:38:23.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He survived.</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.080" end="00:38:27.840" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t you teleport me to the</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.240" end="00:38:31.120" style="s2">castle? I told you I want to fight.</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.840" end="00:38:33.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t fight in this condition.</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.120" end="00:38:36.360" style="s2">Please understand.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.680" end="00:38:36.360" style="s2">Look at them.</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.480" end="00:38:43.000" style="s2">They&#39;re exhausted. They&#39;ve lost hope.</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.000" end="00:38:43.000" style="s2">They need a leader.</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.586" end="00:38:50.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.240" end="00:38:52.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t lose hope.</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.000" end="00:38:56.240" style="s2">We may have lost the castle,</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.480" end="00:38:56.240" style="s2">but one day we&#39;ll take it back.</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.560" end="00:39:00.400" style="s2">Right now,</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.800" end="00:39:00.400" style="s2">we have to be strong. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.672" end="00:39:58.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.320" end="00:40:04.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are we even supposed to go?</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.720" end="00:40:06.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.760" end="00:40:07.920" style="s2">there&#39;s nowhere left to go?</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.880" end="00:40:09.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are we going?</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.920" end="00:40:10.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are we going to do?</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.040" end="00:40:13.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we keep wandering like this, we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.440" end="00:40:13.760" style="s2">going to die out here.</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.800" end="00:40:20.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re going to the humans. We&#39;re going</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.960" end="00:40:20.440" style="s2">to ask the humans for help.</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.698" end="00:40:34.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.240" end="00:40:49.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We should stop somewhere. Look at them.</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.108" end="00:40:49.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.360" end="00:40:52.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re exhausted.</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.880" end="00:40:58.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s dangerous to [music] stop here.</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.920" end="00:41:11.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know a cave a few kilometers [music]</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.040" end="00:41:11.560" style="s2">from here.</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.680" end="00:41:17.240" style="s2">We could stop there.</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.600" end="00:41:17.240" style="s2">We might even find something to eat.</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.080" end="00:41:23.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.160" end="00:41:26.040" style="s2">They&#39;ll need rest after everything</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.360" end="00:41:26.040" style="s2">they&#39;ve been through.</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.543" end="00:41:39.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.508" end="00:41:41.560" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.640" end="00:41:44.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Goblins!</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.560" end="00:41:44.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hide!</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.880" end="00:42:03.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alora!</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.400" end="00:42:05.000" style="s2">I can help you to defeat the goblins.</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.120" end="00:42:06.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No!</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.000" end="00:42:10.480" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to lose you, too.</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.760" end="00:42:10.480" style="s2">Hide with the others. Go!</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.979" end="00:42:29.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.599" end="00:42:32.619" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.459" end="00:42:40.479" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.629" end="00:42:49.649" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.840" end="00:44:11.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ugh!</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.260" end="00:44:25.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.760" end="00:44:49.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think that was all of them.</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.640" end="00:44:53.960" style="s2">It was an honor to fight side by side</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.040" end="00:44:53.960" style="s2">with you, my princess.</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.360" end="00:44:58.640" style="s2">By the way,</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.840" end="00:45:01.560" style="s2">I&#39;m Aaron.</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.640" end="00:45:01.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice to meet you, Aaron.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.200" end="00:45:13.800" style="s2">It&#39;s safe. You can come out. The goblins</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.920" end="00:45:15.800" style="s2">are gone.</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.800" end="00:45:17.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next time, maybe you could fight with us</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.800" end="00:45:21.240" style="s2">instead of hiding behind a rock.</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.880" end="00:45:21.240" style="s2">Elara and I fought them alone.</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.556" end="00:45:23.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.920" end="00:45:24.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.200" end="00:45:26.480" style="s2">They just lost their home. They&#39;re still</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.680" end="00:45:28.800" style="s2">in shock. They&#39;ll find their courage</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.480" end="00:45:33.200" style="s2">again. Give them time.</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.800" end="00:45:33.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My princess, next time we&#39;ll fight.</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.240" end="00:45:35.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope so.</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.040" end="00:45:42.040" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.320" end="00:45:43.520" style="s2">The cave isn&#39;t far.</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.040" end="00:45:45.760" style="s2">We can rest there and finally get</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.520" end="00:45:47.400" style="s2">something to eat.</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.760" end="00:45:49.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, let&#39;s go. I want us there</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.400" end="00:45:51.840" style="s2">before dark.</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.360" end="00:45:51.840" style="s2">Keep moving.</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.840" end="00:46:12.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.240" end="00:46:15.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t have much farther to go, little</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.640" end="00:46:18.240" style="s2">one.</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.800" end="00:46:18.240" style="s2">Okay?</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.080" end="00:46:32.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wish I could teleport to places I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.680" end="00:46:34.520" style="s2">never been, but I can&#39;t. I wish I could</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.960" end="00:46:36.280" style="s2">teleport straight to the humans&#39; castle,</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.520" end="00:46:37.600" style="s2">but I&#39;ve never been there.</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.280" end="00:46:39.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red,</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.600" end="00:46:42.160" style="s2">we&#39;ll reach the humans soon. Just hold</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.720" end="00:46:44.560" style="s2">on a little longer.</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.160" end="00:46:45.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, we&#39;ve made it.</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.560" end="00:46:47.480" style="s2">The cave is right in front of us. Come</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.840" end="00:46:49.880" style="s2">on.</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.480" end="00:46:49.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.880" end="00:47:00.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll stay here tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.040" end="00:47:02.400" style="s2">Get some rest</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.560" end="00:47:05.360" style="s2">and eat something. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.400" end="00:47:07.000" style="s2">Tomorrow we continue our journey.</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.360" end="00:47:08.400" style="s2">Hopefully, we&#39;ll reach the humans&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.000" end="00:47:12.120" style="s2">castle.</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.400" end="00:47:15.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t have much food left.</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.120" end="00:47:19.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t have any meat left.</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.160" end="00:47:19.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At this rate, our children will starve.</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.280" end="00:47:27.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey,</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.000" end="00:47:30.480" style="s2">there&#39;s a small forest nearby.</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.080" end="00:47:30.480" style="s2">I&#39;ll go and see if I can hunt something.</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.240" end="00:47:35.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll come with you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.280" end="00:47:38.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As you wish, my princess.</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.003" end="00:47:47.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.760" end="00:48:46.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My king,</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.320" end="00:48:48.120" style="s2">we&#39;ve just received the latest reports</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.440" end="00:48:50.400" style="s2">from our scouts.</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.120" end="00:48:52.468" style="s2">I&#39;m afraid I have bad news.</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.400" end="00:48:53.123" style="s2">What happened? Speak.</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.468" end="00:48:53.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.123" end="00:48:57.440" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.600" end="00:48:59.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Elven stronghold has fallen. Fallen?</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.440" end="00:49:01.400" style="s2">To whom? The orcs, my king. They&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.800" end="00:49:04.640" style="s2">taken control of the stronghold. The</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.400" end="00:49:07.000" style="s2">Elven forces were destroyed.</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.640" end="00:49:09.360" style="s2">That&#39;s impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.000" end="00:49:11.920" style="s2">THAT STRONGHOLD WAS THE BARRIER BETWEEN</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.360" end="00:49:14.520" style="s2">US AND THE ORCS.</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.920" end="00:49:16.160" style="s2">IF THE ELVEN STRONGHOLD is gone,</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.520" end="00:49:18.840" style="s2">there is nothing standing between their</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.160" end="00:49:21.920" style="s2">army and us.</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.840" end="00:49:21.920" style="s2">We&#39;re exposed.</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.960" end="00:49:25.520" style="s2">The orcs could march against us at any</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.720" end="00:49:28.040" style="s2">moment.</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.520" end="00:49:29.440" style="s2">Where is Lucas? Where is my son?</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.040" end="00:49:33.800" style="s2">Training in the courtyard, my king.</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.440" end="00:49:33.800" style="s2">Bring him to me now. Go, quickly.</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.280" end="00:50:27.444" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for the training, my friend.</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.280" end="00:50:29.464" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My prince, the king is asking for you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.444" end="00:50:29.464" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and panting]</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.360" end="00:50:38.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucas.</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.520" end="00:50:42.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother.</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.960" end="00:50:43.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you going in such a hurry?</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.000" end="00:50:46.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father sent for me. Apparently, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.720" end="00:50:46.360" style="s2">urgent.</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.120" end="00:50:50.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You could at least try to look a prince</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.320" end="00:50:52.000" style="s2">before you stand before the king.</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.200" end="00:50:53.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you like me better this way.</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.000" end="00:50:54.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.240" end="00:50:56.400" style="s2">Your father, however, may have a</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.480" end="00:50:57.920" style="s2">different opinion.</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.400" end="00:50:58.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He usually does.</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.920" end="00:51:00.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucas.</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.920" end="00:51:01.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? You know him, right?</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.680" end="00:51:03.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He is your king.</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.760" end="00:51:05.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And my father.</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.000" end="00:51:05.440" style="s2">I know.</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.240" end="00:51:10.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He seemed worried.</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.760" end="00:51:12.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did he tell you why?</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.320" end="00:51:14.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.160" end="00:51:15.200" style="s2">But I know your father.</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.080" end="00:51:17.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother.</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.200" end="00:51:18.920" style="s2">Whatever it is, I&#39;ll handle it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.320" end="00:51:20.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You always say that.</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.920" end="00:51:22.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you always worry.</p>
<p begin="00:51:20.360" end="00:51:23.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m your mother. That is my privilege.</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.640" end="00:51:25.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I suppose there&#39;s no point arguing</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.960" end="00:51:29.280" style="s2">with the queen.</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.000" end="00:51:29.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally, something sensible from my son.</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.280" end="00:51:31.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll see you at dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.920" end="00:51:33.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t make a promise you can&#39;t keep.</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.360" end="00:51:34.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be there.</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.000" end="00:51:35.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go. Don&#39;t keep your father waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.960" end="00:51:36.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother.</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.640" end="00:51:37.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.440" end="00:51:40.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.640" end="00:51:40.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love you, too, Lucas.</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.040" end="00:51:52.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you really think the humans will help</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.360" end="00:51:54.320" style="s2">us?</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.640" end="00:51:55.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.320" end="00:51:58.040" style="s2">But we have to try. We have nowhere else</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.640" end="00:51:58.040" style="s2">to go.</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.160" end="00:52:01.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The orcs took everything from me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.200" end="00:52:03.000" style="s2">My family,</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.560" end="00:52:05.920" style="s2">they&#39;re all gone.</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.000" end="00:52:07.800" style="s2">I have no one left.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.920" end="00:52:10.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, Anduin.</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.800" end="00:52:12.120" style="s2">I lost my father, too.</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.280" end="00:52:14.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard stories about him.</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.120" end="00:52:15.680" style="s2">He was a good king.</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.040" end="00:52:17.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He was.</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.680" end="00:52:20.280" style="s2">He gave everything for our kingdom, even</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.800" end="00:52:22.720" style="s2">his life.</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.280" end="00:52:22.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shh.</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.400" end="00:52:46.480" style="s2">Got you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.120" end="00:52:46.480" style="s2">Come on. Let&#39;s get our food.</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.440" end="00:53:02.880" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.800" end="00:53:17.720" style="s2">BEHIND YOU!</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.056" end="00:53:21.076" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.880" end="00:53:29.591" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALANA!</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.571" end="00:53:29.591" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.280" end="00:53:32.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALANA!</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.847" end="00:53:32.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.707" end="00:53:40.727" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.602" end="00:53:46.622" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.497" end="00:53:54.482" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.462" end="00:53:54.482" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.720" end="00:53:59.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU TOOK YOUR TIME.</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.400" end="00:53:59.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re welcome.</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.597" end="00:54:05.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.920" end="00:54:10.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We should hurry. It&#39;ll be dark soon.</p>
<p begin="00:54:08.320" end="00:54:12.840" style="s2">It&#39;s not safe to stay here. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.280" end="00:54:12.840" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.400" end="00:54:25.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally, you&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="00:54:23.160" end="00:54:27.600" style="s2">If you expect to be king one day, start</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.280" end="00:54:29.280" style="s2">acting like one. Be serious. Be</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.600" end="00:54:30.840" style="s2">punctual.</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.280" end="00:54:32.400" style="s2">Be a man.</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.840" end="00:54:35.200" style="s2">Tell me what happened.</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.400" end="00:54:35.200" style="s2">How can I help?</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.960" end="00:54:40.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Elven kingdom has fallen.</p>
<p begin="00:54:41.200" end="00:54:46.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.480" end="00:54:46.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Orcs took their stronghold.</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.172" end="00:54:47.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.320" end="00:54:49.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How many survived?</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.640" end="00:54:50.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is not our concern.</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.200" end="00:54:53.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not our concern?</p>
<p begin="00:54:50.400" end="00:54:54.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Elves lost their kingdom, Lucas. My</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.120" end="00:54:55.680" style="s2">concern is making sure we don&#39;t lose</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.960" end="00:54:58.120" style="s2">ours.</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.680" end="00:54:58.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There could be families out there.</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.120" end="00:55:01.160" style="s2">Children.</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.920" end="00:55:03.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I have thousands of families inside</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.160" end="00:55:04.200" style="s2">these walls depending on me.</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.120" end="00:55:05.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, we just abandon them?</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.200" end="00:55:07.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If helping them puts our own people at</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.880" end="00:55:08.640" style="s2">risk, yes.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.240" end="00:55:09.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They stood between us and the Orcs for</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.640" end="00:55:12.240" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.240" end="00:55:13.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They defended their land.</p>
<p begin="00:55:12.240" end="00:55:14.960" style="s2">Don&#39;t mistake necessity for sacrifice.</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.700" end="00:55:16.440" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.960" end="00:55:17.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They still died fighting the same enemy</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.440" end="00:55:20.400" style="s2">we may face tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.560" end="00:55:21.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re thinking like a boy.</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.400" end="00:55:23.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe.</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.600" end="00:55:24.760" style="s2">But leaving an innocent people to die</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.080" end="00:55:26.760" style="s2">doesn&#39;t make me a man.</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.760" end="00:55:29.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Elks are nothing to you.</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.760" end="00:55:29.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re people.</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.440" end="00:55:41.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is a reason I called you here.</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.360" end="00:55:42.320" style="s2">Three days ago, we lost contact with the</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.360" end="00:55:43.440" style="s2">northern stronghold.</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.320" end="00:55:44.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No messengers?</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.440" end="00:55:45.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; None.</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.160" end="00:55:47.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scouts?</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.000" end="00:55:48.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I sent two. Neither returned.</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.120" end="00:55:50.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want me to go there?</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.400" end="00:55:52.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do. Take six of my best men. Ride</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.760" end="00:55:55.080" style="s2">north, find out what happened, return.</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.600" end="00:55:55.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if I find Elzik&#39;s survivors?</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.080" end="00:55:56.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You leave them.</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.760" end="00:55:58.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father,</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.240" end="00:56:00.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is an order.</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.360" end="00:56:01.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t leave innocent people to die.</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.240" end="00:56:04.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then pray your compassion doesn&#39;t get</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.880" end="00:56:04.560" style="s2">you killed.</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.040" end="00:56:13.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My prince.</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.280" end="00:56:23.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father told me about the northern</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.760" end="00:56:25.320" style="s2">stronghold.</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.920" end="00:56:29.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you know why I&#39;m leaving.</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.320" end="00:56:29.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know the scouts never returned.</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.320" end="00:56:32.480" style="s2">Whatever you find there, don&#39;t let your</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.120" end="00:56:33.560" style="s2">courage become foolishness.</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.480" end="00:56:35.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sound like father.</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.560" end="00:56:36.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.000" end="00:56:38.240" style="s2">Your father wants answers. I want my son</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.960" end="00:56:39.280" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:56:38.240" end="00:56:40.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We argued again.</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.280" end="00:56:41.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; About the elves?</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.480" end="00:56:42.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know?</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.320" end="00:56:45.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know your father.</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.320" end="00:56:45.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He doesn&#39;t want them inside our walls.</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.040" end="00:56:46.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you do.</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.800" end="00:56:48.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ve lost their home, mother. Where</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.920" end="00:56:50.240" style="s2">else are they supposed to go?</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.120" end="00:56:51.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I agree with you. Never forget who you</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.240" end="00:56:53.800" style="s2">are, Lucas.</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.720" end="00:56:54.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My prince, the men are ready to ride.</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.800" end="00:56:57.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be there in a moment.</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.840" end="00:57:00.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, take care, Lucas.</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.200" end="00:57:00.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll see you soon, mother.</p>
<p begin="00:57:33.760" end="00:57:35.760" style="s2">You saved me twice today. Thank you for</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.280" end="00:57:37.440" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.760" end="00:57:39.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You would have done the same.</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.440" end="00:57:41.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.360" end="00:57:42.520" style="s2">Although, I probably would have looked</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.040" end="00:57:44.000" style="s2">better doing it.</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.520" end="00:57:45.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You spent half the afternoon hanging</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.000" end="00:57:47.240" style="s2">from a tree.</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.040" end="00:57:48.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not my finest moment.</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.240" end="00:57:49.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Definitely not.</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.480" end="00:57:51.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You noticed?</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.400" end="00:57:53.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was difficult not to.</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.120" end="00:57:55.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take that as a compliment.</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.240" end="00:57:55.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.760" end="00:58:06.880" style="s2">Hey, you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.520" end="00:58:06.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.920" end="00:58:10.000" style="s2">Aaron likes you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.560" end="00:58:11.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.000" end="00:58:12.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know he does.</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.200" end="00:58:13.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re imagining things.</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.160" end="00:58:15.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not.</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.400" end="00:58:16.280" style="s2">Do you like him?</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.080" end="00:58:17.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have bigger problems.</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.280" end="00:58:18.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not a no.</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.240" end="00:58:19.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red.</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.520" end="00:58:20.720" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.360" end="00:58:21.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sometimes I think I could have stopped</p>
<p begin="00:58:20.720" end="00:58:23.120" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.240" end="00:58:24.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop the orcs?</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.120" end="00:58:25.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I was stronger, maybe more of them</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.600" end="00:58:26.120" style="s2">would still be alive.</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.560" end="00:58:27.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; your fault.</p>
<p begin="00:58:26.120" end="00:58:28.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; have these powers. What&#39;s the point if I</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.440" end="00:58:30.040" style="s2">can&#39;t save anyone?</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.480" end="00:58:30.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Having power doesn&#39;t mean you can save</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.040" end="00:58:32.200" style="s2">everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.960" end="00:58:32.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s something else.</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.200" end="00:58:34.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.960" end="00:58:35.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw something.</p>
<p begin="00:58:34.120" end="00:58:37.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Another vision?</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.320" end="00:58:39.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A city surrounded by mountains.</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.840" end="00:58:40.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The human kingdom?</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.120" end="00:58:41.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe.</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.440" end="00:58:43.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.560" end="00:58:44.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was burning. You were there.</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.680" end="00:58:46.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saw me?</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.800" end="00:58:48.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know what happened to you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.760" end="00:58:49.240" style="s2">I just remember the fire.</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.080" end="00:58:50.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.240" end="00:58:50.840" style="s2">It was a vision. [music] It hasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.360" end="00:58:51.720" style="s2">happened.</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.840" end="00:58:54.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But what if it does?</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.720" end="00:58:55.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we&#39;ll face it.</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.120" end="00:58:58.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to lose you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.480" end="00:58:58.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.350" end="00:59:00.370" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:41.880" end="00:59:46.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s unusually quiet in the stronghold.</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.800" end="00:59:49.920" style="s2">I wonder why.</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.840" end="00:59:49.920" style="s2">Let&#39;s find out what&#39;s going on.</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.920" end="01:00:06.160" style="s2">Check the stronghold.</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.800" end="01:00:07.880" style="s2">But stay together.</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.160" end="01:00:10.440" style="s2">Something isn&#39;t right here. Keep your</p>
<p begin="01:00:07.880" end="01:00:10.440" style="s2">eyes open.</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.520" end="01:00:32.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, well, well.</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.360" end="01:00:36.680" style="s2">What do we have here?</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.800" end="01:00:36.680" style="s2">Prince Lucas himself.</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.120" end="01:00:41.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.440" end="01:00:44.080" style="s2">Where are the people?</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.200" end="01:00:44.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m afraid</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.560" end="01:00:48.640" style="s2">they&#39;re all dead.</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.760" end="01:00:53.040" style="s2">Allow me to introduce myself.</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.520" end="01:00:55.600" style="s2">But</p>
<p begin="01:00:53.040" end="01:00:55.600" style="s2">wait.</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.627" end="01:01:15.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.592" end="01:01:17.267" style="s2">[panting and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.247" end="01:01:17.267" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.440" end="01:01:20.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Much better.</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.762" end="01:01:25.782" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.680" end="01:01:34.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m wondering, should I kill you now</p>
<p begin="01:01:32.720" end="01:01:36.880" style="s2">or later?</p>
<p begin="01:01:34.897" end="01:01:39.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.880" end="01:01:39.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s see.</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.447" end="01:01:43.467" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming and groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.997" end="01:01:50.017" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.440" end="01:01:57.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next.</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.682" end="01:02:07.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.013" end="01:03:04.033" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.218" end="01:03:11.238" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.120" end="01:03:19.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Show&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.520" end="01:03:29.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wake up, everyone. We&#39;re moving out.</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.360" end="01:03:31.240" style="s2">Pack only what you need. We have a long</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.320" end="01:03:34.520" style="s2">road ahead.</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.240" end="01:03:34.520" style="s2">Red, wake up.</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.640" end="01:03:38.200" style="s2">Did you sleep well?</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.680" end="01:03:40.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not really.</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.200" end="01:03:41.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today we have to reach the human castle.</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.680" end="01:03:44.200" style="s2">Once we&#39;re there, you&#39;ll finally get</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.720" end="01:03:46.560" style="s2">some proper rest.</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.200" end="01:03:46.560" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.600" end="01:03:52.640" style="s2">10 minutes.</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.880" end="01:04:06.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know, most people rest after almost</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.400" end="01:04:07.514" style="s2">getting killed.</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.720" end="01:04:07.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I rested.</p>
<p begin="01:04:07.514" end="01:04:08.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:07.640" end="01:04:10.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For 3 hours?</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.720" end="01:04:12.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three excellent hours.</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.520" end="01:04:13.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re terrible at resting.</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.040" end="01:04:15.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re terrible at being quiet. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:13.480" end="01:04:18.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yet somehow you keep me around.</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.400" end="01:04:18.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m still trying to understand why.</p>
<p begin="01:04:26.509" end="01:04:28.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.200" end="01:04:33.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone&#39;s almost ready.</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.240" end="01:04:35.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Almost?</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.960" end="01:04:36.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apparently packing [music] an entire</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.120" end="01:04:37.360" style="s2">life takes longer than 10 minutes.</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.520" end="01:04:38.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help them.</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.360" end="01:04:39.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was hoping you&#39;d say good morning.</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.320" end="01:04:40.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning. Help [music] them.</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.400" end="01:04:41.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Much better.</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.520" end="01:04:42.320" style="s2">There&#39;s a shorter path through the</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.360" end="01:04:42.920" style="s2">northern pass.</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.320" end="01:04:44.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where does it lead?</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.920" end="01:04:47.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Straight to the human road.</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.600" end="01:04:47.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then that&#39;s our way.</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.440" end="01:05:15.640" style="s2">Do you like each other?</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.560" end="01:05:16.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.640" end="01:05:17.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t say anything.</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.520" end="01:05:19.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t have to.</p>
<p begin="01:05:17.880" end="01:05:23.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you like each other,</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.680" end="01:05:23.000" style="s2">why don&#39;t you just kiss?</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.800" end="01:05:28.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep walking.</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.200" end="01:05:29.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That wasn&#39;t a no.</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.400" end="01:05:30.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you,</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.520" end="01:05:31.800" style="s2">stop smiling.</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.800" end="01:05:32.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not smiling.</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.800" end="01:05:36.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are.</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.920" end="01:05:36.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He definitely is.</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.560" end="01:05:42.440" style="s2">What kind of man do you like?</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.720" end="01:05:44.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One who doesn&#39;t ask unnecessary</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.440" end="01:05:46.000" style="s2">questions.</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.000" end="01:05:48.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sounds promising.</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.000" end="01:05:52.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.360" end="01:05:53.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about tall, dark hair, blue eyes?</p>
<p begin="01:05:52.360" end="01:05:54.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red.</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.600" end="01:05:55.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.600" end="01:05:57.400" style="s2">I&#39;m just asking.</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.920" end="01:05:58.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d also like to hear the answer.</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.400" end="01:06:00.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep walking, Earn.</p>
<p begin="01:05:58.840" end="01:06:02.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, princess.</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.440" end="01:06:03.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does Alora ever laugh?</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.120" end="01:06:04.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve heard stories.</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.360" end="01:06:06.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Careful.</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.200" end="01:06:06.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some say it happened once, many years</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.160" end="01:06:07.920" style="s2">ago.</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.720" end="01:06:10.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.920" end="01:06:10.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one survived to confirm it.</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.000" end="01:06:12.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.920" end="01:06:13.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re both very funny.</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.360" end="01:06:15.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Was that sarcasm?</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.680" end="01:06:17.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alora,</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.080" end="01:06:19.600" style="s2">are there princes in the human kingdom?</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.880" end="01:06:22.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.600" end="01:06:22.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Handsome ones?</p>
<p begin="01:06:22.680" end="01:06:28.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why does that matter?</p>
<p begin="01:06:24.720" end="01:06:28.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Asking for you.</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.520" end="01:06:34.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She doesn&#39;t need a human prince.</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.440" end="01:06:36.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And why exactly do you care?</p>
<p begin="01:06:34.800" end="01:06:38.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.880" end="01:06:40.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You care.</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.680" end="01:06:42.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red.</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.000" end="01:06:42.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You do.</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.600" end="01:06:46.640" style="s2">Maybe the prince will like Alora.</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.400" end="01:06:49.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sure he&#39;ll have more important</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.640" end="01:06:53.240" style="s2">things to worry about.</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.640" end="01:06:53.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sound jealous.</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.040" end="01:06:58.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not jealous.</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.040" end="01:07:10.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you see?</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.680" end="01:07:16.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring me Shadow.</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.640" end="01:07:16.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Princess.</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.520" end="01:07:24.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You lead them from here.</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.040" end="01:07:25.480" style="s2">The human castle isn&#39;t far. Keep</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.640" end="01:07:28.080" style="s2">everyone moving.</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.480" end="01:07:28.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you see?</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.720" end="01:07:32.080" style="s2">Let me come with you.</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.640" end="01:07:32.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.240" end="01:07:35.960" style="s2">Take care of Red</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.000" end="01:07:38.160" style="s2">and the others.</p>
<p begin="01:07:35.960" end="01:07:40.200" style="s2">Get them safely to the human castle.</p>
<p begin="01:07:38.160" end="01:07:42.800" style="s2">I&#39;ll meet you there before nightfall.</p>
<p begin="01:07:40.200" end="01:07:42.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be careful.</p>
<p begin="01:08:13.360" end="01:08:15.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are we going to do with the prince,</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.520" end="01:08:18.720" style="s2">boss?</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.360" end="01:08:18.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re going to make a fortune off</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.279" end="01:08:23.520" style="s2">his father will pay a handsome ransom to</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.480" end="01:08:26.440" style="s2">get him [music] back.</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.520" end="01:08:26.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good idea, boss.</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.319" end="01:08:33.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.799" end="01:08:36.839" style="s2">One at a time.</p>
<p begin="01:08:33.600" end="01:08:36.839" style="s2">The bridge won&#39;t hold us all.</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.319" end="01:08:46.960" style="s2">Next.</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.720" end="01:09:03.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t have all day.</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.440" end="01:09:13.400" style="s2">Come on, one more.</p>
<p begin="01:09:09.880" end="01:09:13.400" style="s2">Then send the prince [music] across.</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.023" end="01:09:18.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:09:35.040" end="01:09:37.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get her!</p>
<p begin="01:09:35.672" end="01:09:37.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.799" end="01:09:56.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; COME ON, YOU FOOLS!</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.720" end="01:09:56.560" style="s2">KILL HER!</p>
<p begin="01:10:46.160" end="01:10:48.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT&#39;S HAPPENING?</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.684" end="01:11:12.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.480" end="01:11:12.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THERE!</p>
<p begin="01:11:44.600" end="01:11:49.760" style="s2">GO AROUND.</p>
<p begin="01:11:46.680" end="01:11:49.760" style="s2">TAKE HER DOWN.</p>
<p begin="01:12:09.120" end="01:12:12.480" style="s2">FOR GOD&#39;S SAKE.</p>
<p begin="01:12:19.680" end="01:12:23.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Incompetent fools.</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.760" end="01:12:34.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. WE&#39;LL CATCH THEM OURSELVES.</p>
<p begin="01:12:32.280" end="01:12:34.880" style="s2">MOVE.</p>
<p begin="01:12:47.590" end="01:12:49.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:12:53.960" end="01:12:57.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I ASSUME YOU&#39;RE NOT WITH THEM.</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.760" end="01:12:58.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT GAVE ME AWAY?</p>
<p begin="01:12:57.160" end="01:13:00.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Subtle clues.</p>
<p begin="01:12:58.400" end="01:13:02.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. You&#39;re observant.</p>
<p begin="01:13:00.400" end="01:13:03.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="01:13:02.160" end="01:13:04.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone who just saved you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:03.920" end="01:13:07.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not a name.</p>
<p begin="01:13:04.840" end="01:13:08.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And that wasn&#39;t an answer I promised.</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.440" end="01:13:08.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fair enough.</p>
<p begin="01:13:08.080" end="01:13:10.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about you?</p>
<p begin="01:13:08.920" end="01:13:11.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone who was just saved.</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.480" end="01:13:12.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not a name.</p>
<p begin="01:13:11.440" end="01:13:15.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I learn quickly.</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.760" end="01:13:16.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apparently. Can you ride?</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.000" end="01:13:18.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Under better circumstances, yes.</p>
<p begin="01:13:16.680" end="01:13:21.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These are the better circumstances.</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.400" end="01:13:23.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d hate to see the bad ones.</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.200" end="01:13:24.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on.</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.200" end="01:13:26.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:13:24.280" end="01:13:26.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.400" end="01:13:33.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That doesn&#39;t look like nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.880" end="01:13:33.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t feel it.</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.000" end="01:13:35.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey!</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.920" end="01:13:36.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We need to keep move.</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.000" end="01:13:37.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HEY! HEY!</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.600" end="01:13:38.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO!</p>
<p begin="01:13:37.640" end="01:13:39.336" style="s2">STRAIGHT AHEAD!</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.880" end="01:13:39.920" style="s2">COME ON!</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.336" end="01:13:41.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.920" end="01:13:44.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FASTER, HAYAH!</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.520" end="01:13:44.920" style="s2">CATCH THE PRINCE!</p>
<p begin="01:14:08.320" end="01:14:11.800" style="s2">YOU CAN&#39;T ESCAPE!</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.960" end="01:14:15.440" style="s2">COME ON, BOY! FASTER!</p>
<p begin="01:14:44.400" end="01:14:47.600" style="s2">You&#39;ve got to be kidding me!</p>
<p begin="01:15:03.720" end="01:15:06.880" style="s2">I can make it.</p>
<p begin="01:15:16.931" end="01:15:18.951" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:15:28.067" end="01:15:30.087" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.600" end="01:15:38.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re insane. We nearly died back</p>
<p begin="01:15:36.840" end="01:15:39.920" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="01:15:38.000" end="01:15:41.760" style="s2">Oh, don&#39;t argue with me.</p>
<p begin="01:15:39.920" end="01:15:43.480" style="s2">I don&#39;t even know your name.</p>
<p begin="01:15:41.760" end="01:15:44.680" style="s2">But</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.480" end="01:15:46.407" style="s2">I hope your mistress has better</p>
<p begin="01:15:44.680" end="01:15:48.427" style="s2">judgement.</p>
<p begin="01:15:46.407" end="01:15:48.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:15:51.400" end="01:15:55.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy. Easy, boy.</p>
<p begin="01:16:05.600" end="01:16:09.040" style="s2">Hey.</p>
<p begin="01:16:07.000" end="01:16:12.640" style="s2">Can you hear me?</p>
<p begin="01:16:09.040" end="01:16:12.640" style="s2">Come on. Wake up.</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.080" end="01:16:17.902" style="s2">Oh god.</p>
<p begin="01:16:15.882" end="01:16:17.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.807" end="01:16:40.960" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:16:39.760" end="01:16:42.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy.</p>
<p begin="01:16:40.960" end="01:16:44.040" style="s2">You&#39;re safe. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.240" end="01:16:46.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="01:16:44.040" end="01:16:46.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You passed out.</p>
<p begin="01:16:50.960" end="01:16:53.680" style="s2">How you feeling?</p>
<p begin="01:16:54.840" end="01:16:57.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve had better days.</p>
<p begin="01:16:58.280" end="01:17:01.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, on the bright side, you&#39;re still</p>
<p begin="01:16:59.480" end="01:17:02.240" style="s2">alive. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.000" end="01:17:04.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that your professional medical</p>
<p begin="01:17:02.240" end="01:17:06.120" style="s2">opinion?</p>
<p begin="01:17:04.000" end="01:17:07.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My first, actually.</p>
<p begin="01:17:06.120" end="01:17:08.520" style="s2">Is your horse always trying to kill</p>
<p begin="01:17:07.240" end="01:17:11.640" style="s2">people?</p>
<p begin="01:17:08.520" end="01:17:13.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only the ones he doesn&#39;t like.</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.640" end="01:17:15.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That explains the [music] cliff.</p>
<p begin="01:17:13.800" end="01:17:19.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He jumped, didn&#39;t he?</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.640" end="01:17:19.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Without consulting either of us.</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.728" end="01:17:23.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.880" end="01:17:25.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened to your cloak?</p>
<p begin="01:17:23.360" end="01:17:27.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It had an unfortunate encounter with</p>
<p begin="01:17:25.160" end="01:17:29.960" style="s2">your stomach.</p>
<p begin="01:17:27.640" end="01:17:31.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And who [music] won?</p>
<p begin="01:17:29.960" end="01:17:35.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The stomach.</p>
<p begin="01:17:31.440" end="01:17:35.000" style="s2">The cloak is beyond saving.</p>
<p begin="01:17:37.120" end="01:17:42.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those men wanted you alive. Why?</p>
<p begin="01:17:40.600" end="01:17:44.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a charming personality.</p>
<p begin="01:17:42.280" end="01:17:46.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That [music] can&#39;t be it.</p>
<p begin="01:17:44.680" end="01:17:51.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re remarkably difficult to impress.</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.800" end="01:17:51.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m remarkably easy to disappoint.</p>
<p begin="01:17:53.640" end="01:17:57.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you always rescue strangers?</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.320" end="01:17:58.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only when they&#39;re outnumbered.</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.320" end="01:18:02.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There were four of them.</p>
<p begin="01:17:58.800" end="01:18:04.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. [music] Hardly a fair fight.</p>
<p begin="01:18:02.720" end="01:18:05.760" style="s2">We should get moving.</p>
<p begin="01:18:04.040" end="01:18:09.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can barely sit right.</p>
<p begin="01:18:05.760" end="01:18:09.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Standing should be an improvement.</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.960" end="01:18:13.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Would you like some help?</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.000" end="01:18:17.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I [music] can manage.</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.120" end="01:18:22.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impressive.</p>
<p begin="01:18:19.600" end="01:18:22.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sound surprised.</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.919" end="01:18:27.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:18:25.480" end="01:18:29.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Would you like to lean closer?</p>
<p begin="01:18:27.840" end="01:18:31.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not particularly.</p>
<p begin="01:18:29.200" end="01:18:33.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll just keep catching you then.</p>
<p begin="01:18:31.320" end="01:18:37.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Try not to make a habit of it.</p>
<p begin="01:18:33.920" end="01:18:37.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll do my best. No promises.</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.080" end="01:18:42.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just until I can walk.</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.840" end="01:18:50.800" style="s2">Come here, boy.</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.840" end="01:18:56.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please tell me he&#39;s in a better [music]</p>
<p begin="01:18:53.960" end="01:18:56.400" style="s2">mood.</p>
<p begin="01:19:17.400" end="01:19:20.800" style="s2">Hey.</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.360" end="01:19:20.800" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:19:48.960" end="01:19:52.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that where the humans live?</p>
<p begin="01:19:50.840" end="01:19:54.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:19:52.200" end="01:19:58.000" style="s2">We finally made it.</p>
<p begin="01:19:54.920" end="01:19:58.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will they let us in?</p>
<p begin="01:19:58.200" end="01:20:00.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope so.</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.800" end="01:20:11.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you and what brings you to</p>
<p begin="01:20:10.380" end="01:20:14.960" style="s2">[music] our gates?</p>
<p begin="01:20:11.880" end="01:20:15.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We seek shelter. Our kingdom has fallen.</p>
<p begin="01:20:14.960" end="01:20:20.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The elves have guarded [music] their</p>
<p begin="01:20:15.840" end="01:20:21.840" style="s2">borders for centuries. What happened?</p>
<p begin="01:20:20.080" end="01:20:25.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too many orcs.</p>
<p begin="01:20:21.840" end="01:20:27.480" style="s2">I&#39;ve never seen an army that size.</p>
<p begin="01:20:25.160" end="01:20:29.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And where is that army now?</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.480" end="01:20:31.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s what should worry you.</p>
<p begin="01:20:29.920" end="01:20:33.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bringing strangers [music] inside these</p>
<p begin="01:20:31.280" end="01:20:34.640" style="s2">walls is no small risk.</p>
<p begin="01:20:33.160" end="01:20:36.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neither is leaving children outside</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.640" end="01:20:36.880" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="01:20:37.440" end="01:20:44.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This decision belongs to the king.</p>
<p begin="01:20:39.960" end="01:20:44.160" style="s2">Wait here. I&#39;ll speak to his majesty.</p>
<p begin="01:20:56.800" end="01:21:00.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your majesty,</p>
<p begin="01:20:58.240" end="01:21:01.320" style="s2">the Elven refugees have arrived.</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.480" end="01:21:02.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How many?</p>
<p begin="01:21:01.320" end="01:21:04.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hundreds.</p>
<p begin="01:21:02.880" end="01:21:06.440" style="s2">Mostly women, children, and wounded</p>
<p begin="01:21:04.640" end="01:21:10.120" style="s2">soldiers.</p>
<p begin="01:21:06.440" end="01:21:10.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you expect us to feed them all?</p>
<p begin="01:21:11.600" end="01:21:13.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They have nowhere else to go, your</p>
<p begin="01:21:12.840" end="01:21:16.600" style="s2">majesty.</p>
<p begin="01:21:13.960" end="01:21:18.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our stores must last through winter.</p>
<p begin="01:21:16.600" end="01:21:19.920" style="s2">Every mouth [music] we feed is one less</p>
<p begin="01:21:18.440" end="01:21:21.960" style="s2">we can protect.</p>
<p begin="01:21:19.920" end="01:21:25.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And leaving them outside our walls may</p>
<p begin="01:21:21.960" end="01:21:25.360" style="s2">cost us more than bread.</p>
<p begin="01:21:27.011" end="01:21:29.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:21:27.760" end="01:21:32.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Any word from Lucas?</p>
<p begin="01:21:29.520" end="01:21:34.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; None, your majesty.</p>
<p begin="01:21:32.120" end="01:21:37.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My son is missing, and now hundreds seek</p>
<p begin="01:21:34.600" end="01:21:40.240" style="s2">refuge at our gates. Keep the gates</p>
<p begin="01:21:37.000" end="01:21:43.160" style="s2">closed. Send them food and water.</p>
<p begin="01:21:40.240" end="01:21:43.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, your majesty.</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.316" end="01:21:49.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:21:53.866" end="01:21:55.886" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:21:56.040" end="01:21:59.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Orcs! Run!</p>
<p begin="01:22:03.036" end="01:22:05.056" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:22:15.320" end="01:22:17.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RUN!</p>
<p begin="01:22:30.547" end="01:22:32.567" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:22:34.320" end="01:22:38.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GO.</p>
<p begin="01:22:35.320" end="01:22:38.360" style="s2">DON&#39;T LOOK BACK.</p>
<p begin="01:22:44.957" end="01:22:46.977" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:22:49.600" end="01:22:53.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; PLEASE,</p>
<p begin="01:22:50.520" end="01:22:53.240" style="s2">BE QUIET.</p>
<p begin="01:22:56.720" end="01:22:59.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LEAVE THEM ALONE.</p>
<p begin="01:23:02.520" end="01:23:04.607" style="s2">TAKE THEM.</p>
<p begin="01:23:03.640" end="01:23:06.627" style="s2">RUN.</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.607" end="01:23:06.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:23:28.187" end="01:23:32.172" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:23:30.152" end="01:23:32.172" style="s2">[cheering]</p>
<p begin="01:23:35.400" end="01:23:42.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s taking them so long?</p>
<p begin="01:23:38.840" end="01:23:42.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t think they want to let us in.</p>
<p begin="01:23:45.120" end="01:23:49.320" style="s2">The king has ordered food and water for</p>
<p begin="01:23:47.120" end="01:23:52.840" style="s2">your people.</p>
<p begin="01:23:49.320" end="01:23:54.600" style="s2">But he will not allow you inside.</p>
<p begin="01:23:52.840" end="01:23:57.320" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:23:54.600" end="01:23:58.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Imagine if you were in our place.</p>
<p begin="01:23:57.320" end="01:24:01.760" style="s2">There are children,</p>
<p begin="01:23:58.680" end="01:24:04.200" style="s2">elderly people. Let them inside, please.</p>
<p begin="01:24:01.760" end="01:24:04.200" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="01:24:15.520" end="01:24:19.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:24:16.800" end="01:24:19.880" style="s2">Those are the king&#39;s orders.</p>
<p begin="01:24:42.640" end="01:24:45.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alora!</p>
<p begin="01:24:47.920" end="01:24:52.520" style="s2">I missed you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:50.080" end="01:24:55.280" style="s2">I missed you, too.</p>
<p begin="01:24:52.520" end="01:24:58.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alora, you&#39;re hurt.</p>
<p begin="01:24:55.280" end="01:24:58.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m all right, Aaron.</p>
<p begin="01:24:59.280" end="01:25:02.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And who is he?</p>
<p begin="01:25:02.800" end="01:25:05.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucas.</p>
<p begin="01:25:05.320" end="01:25:07.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Prince Lucas?</p>
<p begin="01:25:07.080" end="01:25:09.440" style="s2">You&#39;re alive.</p>
<p begin="01:25:07.880" end="01:25:12.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="01:25:09.440" end="01:25:12.520" style="s2">You&#39;re the prince?</p>
<p begin="01:25:12.600" end="01:25:15.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was going to tell you.</p>
<p begin="01:25:17.800" end="01:25:23.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a prince?</p>
<p begin="01:25:20.200" end="01:25:23.920" style="s2">Alora&#39;s a princess, too.</p>
<p begin="01:25:25.400" end="01:25:31.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a princess?</p>
<p begin="01:25:27.920" end="01:25:31.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was going to tell you.</p>
<p begin="01:25:50.240" end="01:25:54.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are the gates closed? [music]</p>
<p begin="01:25:52.720" end="01:25:56.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father ordered us to keep them</p>
<p begin="01:25:54.240" end="01:25:56.840" style="s2">outside.</p>
<p begin="01:25:57.880" end="01:26:02.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then open the gates.</p>
<p begin="01:26:00.640" end="01:26:02.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But, your highness, your father won&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="01:26:02.160" end="01:26:04.440" style="s2">pleased.</p>
<p begin="01:26:02.920" end="01:26:06.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll deal with my father. Open the</p>
<p begin="01:26:04.440" end="01:26:06.920" style="s2">gates.</p>
<p begin="01:26:22.960" end="01:26:27.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Lucas,</p>
<p begin="01:26:24.800" end="01:26:30.000" style="s2">for giving my people shelter.</p>
<p begin="01:26:27.520" end="01:26:33.040" style="s2">After everything they&#39;ve lost,</p>
<p begin="01:26:30.000" end="01:26:35.320" style="s2">this means more than you know.</p>
<p begin="01:26:33.040" end="01:26:36.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They kept us [music] outside all day.</p>
<p begin="01:26:35.320" end="01:26:39.920" style="s2">If their people came to our gates, we</p>
<p begin="01:26:36.920" end="01:26:39.920" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t hesitate.</p>
<p begin="01:26:41.760" end="01:26:46.360" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry you had to wait.</p>
<p begin="01:26:43.480" end="01:26:46.360" style="s2">You deserve better.</p>
<p begin="01:26:55.960" end="01:26:58.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope I haven&#39;t caused trouble with</p>
<p begin="01:26:57.280" end="01:27:01.400" style="s2">your father.</p>
<p begin="01:26:58.600" end="01:27:03.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll deal with my father later.</p>
<p begin="01:27:01.400" end="01:27:05.640" style="s2">What matters now is that your people are</p>
<p begin="01:27:03.120" end="01:27:05.640" style="s2">safe.</p>
<p begin="01:27:11.400" end="01:27:15.475" style="s2">Elara,</p>
<p begin="01:27:12.840" end="01:27:17.495" style="s2">are you all right?</p>
<p begin="01:27:15.475" end="01:27:17.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:27:18.520" end="01:27:23.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You need to rest.</p>
<p begin="01:27:20.360" end="01:27:23.040" style="s2">You&#39;ve been through enough.</p>
<p begin="01:27:25.240" end="01:27:29.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOUR HIGHNESS, PLEASE.</p>
<p begin="01:27:28.575" end="01:27:31.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="01:27:29.920" end="01:27:34.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT HAPPENED?</p>
<p begin="01:27:31.560" end="01:27:35.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Orcs attacked our village.</p>
<p begin="01:27:34.000" end="01:27:38.280" style="s2">They burned our homes. We couldn&#39;t stop</p>
<p begin="01:27:35.880" end="01:27:38.280" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="01:27:41.720" end="01:27:45.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, they&#39;ve already reached [music] our</p>
<p begin="01:27:42.760" end="01:27:46.600" style="s2">lands.</p>
<p begin="01:27:45.080" end="01:27:49.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sooner or later, they&#39;ll come for this</p>
<p begin="01:27:46.600" end="01:27:49.120" style="s2">castle.</p>
<p begin="01:27:49.535" end="01:27:51.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:27:50.040" end="01:27:52.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen to me.</p>
<p begin="01:27:51.120" end="01:27:54.080" style="s2">You&#39;re safe here.</p>
<p begin="01:27:52.760" end="01:27:57.160" style="s2">At [music] first light, we&#39;ll send</p>
<p begin="01:27:54.080" end="01:27:57.160" style="s2">soldiers to your village.</p>
<p begin="01:27:57.240" end="01:28:01.000" style="s2">We&#39;ll drive the orcs out [music] and</p>
<p begin="01:27:58.200" end="01:28:01.000" style="s2">take it back.</p>
<p begin="01:28:01.880" end="01:28:04.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, my prince.</p>
<p begin="01:28:06.880" end="01:28:10.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to speak [music] to my father.</p>
<p begin="01:28:10.120" end="01:28:13.240" style="s2">He needs to know what&#39;s coming.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
